      "design": "Same simplified prompt and chunk boundaries for all three variants. Extract text and present only; canonical mapping is deterministic and separate. schema constrains required JSON fields/types; source_schema additionally limits text to contiguous source substrings up to 32 chars, without dictionary or gold. No retries, no bracket completion. Reject malformed, ungrounded and out-of-schema items; keep all 50 cases in denominators.",
